[DOC title=":Pages / Welcome"]

	# testapp

	This app exercises the local `sdocs` workspace package end to end,
	embedded in a SvelteKit app via `sdocs/vite` and `sdocs/explorer`.

	## What it covers

	- **Component docs** — `Button.sdoc` with a preview and examples
	- **Pages** — this file's `[DOC]` block
	- **Layouts** — the `[LAYOUT]` block in `Demo.sdoc`
	- **Embedded mode** — the explorer mounted at `/docs`

[/DOC]
